#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:4
msgid "ServiceNow"
msgstr "ServiceNow"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:9
msgid ""
"IT Service Management (ITSM) is an important area of focus for many "
"organizations. Organizations invested in ServiceNow as an ITSM provider will"
" find that |morpheus| integrates tightly with some of the most-used "
"features. After integrating ServiceNow with |morpheus|, both environments "
"can be used interchangeably and the results are synced to both places. This "
"guide walks administrators through the process of integrating ServiceNow "
"with |morpheus| and how |morpheus| can be used to effectively leverage the "
"best of ServiceNow."
msgstr ""
"IT Service Management (ITSM) es un importante area of focus para muchos "
"organizations. Organizations invested in ServiceNow as un ITSM proveedor "
"será find que |morpheus| integrates tightly con algunos of el la mayoría-"
"used características. After integrating ServiceNow con |morpheus|, both "
"entornos puede be used interchangeably y el resultados son synced to both "
"places. This guía walks administrators a través de el proceso of integrating"
" ServiceNow con |morpheus| y how |morpheus| se puede utilizar para "
"effectively leverage el best of ServiceNow."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:11
msgid ""
"The ServiceNow integration guide is also available as a `PDF download "
"<https://www2.morpheusdata.com/Whitepaper-ServiceNow>`_, which includes "
"additional example use cases and screenshots."
msgstr ""
"The ServiceNow integration guía es también disponible as un `PDF download "
"<https://www2.morpheusdata.com/Whitepaper-ServiceNow>`_, cual includes "
"adicional ejemplo use cases y screenshots."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:13
msgid ""
"Only one |morpheus| appliance should be integrated with a single ServiceNow "
"instance at any given time. Integrating multiple appliances with the same "
"ServiceNow instance can cause issues with sharing |morpheus| Catalog Items "
"through to ServiceNow for ordering from the ServiceNow console. Additional "
"details on Catalog Item sharing are included in this guide."
msgstr ""
"Only one |morpheus| appliance debería be integrated con un único ServiceNow "
"instance at cualquier given time. Integrating múltiples appliances con el "
"mismo ServiceNow instance puede cause issues con sharing |morpheus| Catalog "
"Items a través de to ServiceNow para ordering desde el ServiceNow console. "
"Additional detalles on Catalog Item sharing son incluido en esta guía."

