#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:55
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports integration with single-domain and multi-domain "
"ServiceNow appliances. In multi-domain installations, a selected ServiceNow "
"company can be mapped to a selected |morpheus| Tenant for purposes of "
"exposing |morpheus| Library items only to users within a certain company. In"
" this configuration, ServiceNow integrations should be added in each "
"relevant |morpheus| Tenant. Further setup steps for exposing |morpheus| "
"library items to ServiceNow are included in a later section below."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| supports integration con único-domain y multi-domain ServiceNow "
"appliances. In multi-domain installations, un seleccionado ServiceNow "
"company puede be mapped to un seleccionado |morpheus| Tenant para purposes "
"of exposing |morpheus| Library elementos solo to users dentro de un certain "
"company. In este configuración, ServiceNow integrations debería be agregado "
"in cada relevante |morpheus| Tenant. Further setup pasos para exposing "
"|morpheus| library elementos to ServiceNow son incluido in un later sección "
"a continuación."

