#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:87
msgid "ServiceNow Configuration Management Database (CMDB)"
msgstr "ServiceNow Configuration Management Database (CMDB)"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:89
msgid ""
"ServiceNow CMDB is central to maintaining a complete record of IT "
"infrastructure at many organizations. The |morpheus| ServiceNow integration "
"can create and update configuration item (CIs) records as new services are "
"provisioned or existing services are reconfigured. Once a ServiceNow "
"integration is set as the CMDB for a Cloud or Group, CI records are created "
"and managed by |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"ServiceNow CMDB es central to maintaining un completo registro of IT "
"infrastructure at muchos organizations. The |morpheus| ServiceNow "
"integration puede create y update configuración elemento (CIs) registros as "
"nuevo servicios son provisioned o existente servicios son reconfigured. Once"
" un ServiceNow integration es set as el CMDB para un Cloud o Group, CI "
"registros son creado y managed by |morpheus|."

