#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:118
msgid "Provisioning and CI Records"
msgstr "Aprovisionar and CI Records"

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:120
msgid ""
"With a ServiceNow instance integrated with |morpheus| and the instance set "
"as the CMDB for a |morpheus| Group or Cloud, we will see CI records created "
"as new resources are provisioned to the Cloud or Group in |morpheus|. After "
"the provisioning process has completed, a CI record should exist with a name"
" value equal to the Instance name in |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"With un ServiceNow instance integrated con |morpheus| y la instancia set as "
"el CMDB para un |morpheus| Group o Cloud, we será see CI registros creado as"
" nuevo recursos son provisioned to el Cloud o Group in |morpheus|. After el "
"provisioning proceso tiene completed, un CI registro debería exist con un "
"nombre valor equal to el Instance nombre in |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:122
msgid ""
"Provisioned and active Instances in |morpheus| will have CI records with an "
"\"On\" state in ServiceNow. After they are deleted in |morpheus|, the state "
"value will be rolled to \"Terminated\" in ServiceNow as expected."
msgstr ""
"Provisioned y activo Instances in |morpheus| será tienen CI registros con un"
" \"On\" state in ServiceNow. After they son eliminado in |morpheus|, el "
"state valor será be rolled to \"Terminated\" in ServiceNow as expected."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:124
msgid ""
