#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:232
msgid ""
"In addition to integrating with key ServiceNow features, |morpheus| offers a"
" free plugin directly from the ServiceNow Store. Once the plugin is "
"installed, |morpheus| Self-Service Catalog Items can be presented as "
"provisioning options in the ServiceNow catalog for ordering."
msgstr ""
"Además to integrating con key ServiceNow características, |morpheus| offers "
"un free plugin directly desde el ServiceNow Store. Once el plugin es "
"instalado, |morpheus| Self-Service Catalog Items puede be presented as "
"provisioning opciones in el ServiceNow catalog para ordering."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:234
msgid ""
"Surfacing Catalog Items made with Forms to ServiceNow is not yet supported. "
"If planning to use ServiceNow to order Catalog Items you should not use "
"Forms on any Catalog Items until it is supported."
msgstr ""
"Surfacing Catalog Items made con Forms to ServiceNow no es yet compatible. "
"If planning to use ServiceNow to order Catalog Items you no debería use "
"Forms on cualquier Catalog Items hasta it es compatible."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:236
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| plugin supports integration with ServiceNow whether it’s "
"configured for a single tenant or for multiple domains. When both |morpheus|"
" and ServiceNow are configured for multiple Tenants, we can create "
"ServiceNow integrations in any relevant |morpheus| Tenant and map those to "
"specific companies in ServiceNow. Any exposed library items would only be "
"shared with users in the relevant ServiceNow company. The |morpheus| plugin "
"will automatically detect whether the *ServiceNow Domain Support–Domain "
"Extensions Installer plugin* has been installed and respond accordingly. "
"Additionally, the *User Criteria Scoped API plugin* must also be enabled on "
"the ServiceNow instance for multi-tenant use."
msgstr ""
"The |morpheus| plugin supports integration con ServiceNow whether it’s "
"configurado para un único tenant o para múltiples domains. When both "
"|morpheus| y ServiceNow son configurado para múltiples Tenants, we puede "
"create ServiceNow integrations in cualquier relevante |morpheus| Tenant y "
"map esos to específico companies in ServiceNow. Any exposed library "
"elementos sería solo be shared con users in el relevante ServiceNow company."
" The |morpheus| plugin será automáticamente detect whether el *ServiceNow "
"Domain Support–Domain Extensions Installer plugin* tiene sido instalado y "
"respond accordingly. Adicionalmente, el *User Criteria Scoped API plugin* "
"debe también be habilitado on el ServiceNow instance para multi-tenant use."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:238
msgid ""
"Depending on the scenario, setup steps for the |morpheus| plugin will be "
"slightly different. Setup steps for both single and domain-separated "
"ServiceNow environments are included below."
msgstr ""
"Dependiendo de el scenario, setup pasos para el |morpheus| plugin será be "
"slightly diferente. Setup pasos para both único y domain-separated "
"ServiceNow entornos son incluido a continuación."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:240
msgid ""
"A valid SSL Certificate is required on the |morpheus| Appliance for the "
"ServiceNow plugin to be able to communicate with the appliance."
msgstr ""
"A válido SSL Certificate es requerido on el |morpheus| Appliance para el "
"ServiceNow plugin to be able to communicate con el appliance."

#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:242
msgid ""
"As described below, the |morpheus| ServiceNow plugin requires the use of a "
"|morpheus| service account to integrate back with the |morpheus| appliance. "
"Some symbol characters, specifically \"%\" and \"&\" are valid for use in "
"|morpheus| account passwords but aren't passed correctly when ServiceNow "
"makes its API calls to |morpheus|. It is best not to use these characters in"
" the password for |morpheus| accounts which may be used in the ServiceNow "
"plugin to interface back with |morpheus|. Authentication errors will occur "
"and the plugin will not work. This is a ServiceNow issue which |morpheus| "
"has no control over."
msgstr ""
"As described a continuación, el |morpheus| ServiceNow plugin requires el use"
" of un |morpheus| servicio cuenta to integrate back con el |morpheus| "
"appliance. Some symbol characters, específicamente \"%\" y \"&\" son válido "
"para use in |morpheus| cuenta passwords pero aren't passed correctly cuando "
"ServiceNow makes its API calls to |morpheus|. It es best no to use estos "
"characters in el contraseña para |morpheus| accounts cual puede be used in "
"el ServiceNow plugin to interfaz back con |morpheus|. Authentication errores"
" será occur y el plugin no work. This es un ServiceNow issue cual |morpheus|"
" tiene no control over."

