"``glide.ecc.enable_multidomain_mid`` propiedad in ``sys_properties.list`` be"
" set to ``true`` prior to creating el MID server in el global domain. This "
"allows el MID server to explore cualquier domain para cual it tiene el "
"credentials. The ServiceNow user (cual el MID server authenticates con) debe"
" be in el global domain as well. For más, see `this section of ServiceNow "
"documentation <https://docs.servicenow.com/bundle/rome-servicenow-"
"platform/page/product/mid-"
"server/concept/c_MIDServerDomainSeparation.html>`_."

